# N92 Edu-Italia — public configuration (placeholders only, never real secrets)
# Backend: create a free Supabase project, run supabase/schema.sql then
# supabase/seed.sql in its SQL Editor, then set these two PUBLIC values.
# The anon key is safe to expose: Row Level Security restricts it to reading
# published content and submitting enquiries. NEVER put the service-role key,
# a database password or any secret key in this file or anywhere in the site.
# Until these are set, the site runs in clearly-labelled DEMO mode (starter
# dataset shown; enquiries are stored only in the visitor's own browser and
# are NOT transmitted anywhere).
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key
